Scope
-----

The Apache-2.0 license above covers the whole of this repository unless a file
states otherwise:

* the Rust sources, the frontend under `ui/`, the tools under `tools/` and
  `scripts/`, and the guest plugin crates under `plugins/`;
* the hand-authored rigs and their sprite sheets under `models/` (including
  the creature rigs generated by `plugins/metamorphosis`);
* the documentation (`README.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `API.md`,
  `MODEL_FORMAT.md`, `PLUGINS.md`, `CONFIGURATION.md`, the notes under `docs/`);
* the persona text seeded from `SOUL.md`.

